   - Geopolitical context (e.g., "the country that grows the most tobacco in the world" = China)
   - Historical events and dates (e.g., Alanders attempted to rejoin Sweden in 1917)
   - Relationships between people (e.g., Chabi is spouse of Kublai Khan)
   - Locations tied to specific events or people (e.g., Stockholm hosts Embassy of France and is where Abraham Hirsch died)

